config MT6739_WLAN
	tristate "MediaTek MT6739 CONSYS Wi-Fi driver (gen2)"
	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK && CFG80211 && MTK_MT6739_CONSYS
	help
	  MediaTek wlan gen2 driver for the Wi-Fi part of the MT6739
	  integrated connectivity block (CONSYS), using the AHB host
	  interface. Station mode only.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called mt6739-wlan.
